        "original_id": "b355c71e-f30f-5f15-b8d3-a14074f62e92",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Skittles\n- Companies: Wrigley Company, Mars, Incorporated\n- People: Mars family\n- Places: McLean, unincorporated Fairfax County, Virginia, United States\n- Media: Darkened Skye\n- Characters: Skye\n- Concepts: magic, firearms, melee weapons, energy weapons\n\nFacts:\n- Skittles is a brand of fruit-flavoured sweets.\n- Skittles is currently produced and marketed by the Wrigley Company.\n- The Wrigley Company is a division of Mars, Incorporated.\n- Mars, Incorporated is headquartered in McLean, unincorporated Fairfax County, Virginia, United States.\n- Mars, Incorporated is entirely owned by the Mars family.\n- In Darkened Skye, Skye does not use firearms.\n- In Darkened Skye, Skye can perform magic using Skittles candies.\n- In Darkened Skye, Skye uses her staff as a melee weapon.\n- In Darkened Skye, Skye's staff becomes an energy weapon when used in conjunction with Skittles.",
